DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
701::$$$message_0002_0000_0000$$$::I chase the silhouette.[lr]::
702::$$$message_0002_0000_0001$$$::This time, I need to follow and meet her.[lr]::
703::$$$message_0002_0000_0002$$$::...That's right.[lr]::
704::$$$message_0002_0000_0003$$$::To stop that night from happening again. That night I still don't know.::
705::$$$message_0002_0001_0000$$$::I exit the temple yard.[lr]::
706::$$$message_0002_0001_0001$$$::The shadow goes toward the forest behind the temple. Fleeing from, or perhaps inviting, me.[lr]::
707::$$$message_0002_0001_0002$$$::...It's all right. I can catch up to them.[lr]::
708::$$$message_0002_0001_0003$$$::It's less than an hour before midnight.[lr]::
709::$$$message_0002_0001_0004$$$::If I can catch them before then, I'll finally learn the truth behind this four-day loop!::
710::$$$message_0002_0002_0000$$$::My vision opens up.[lr]::
711::$$$message_0002_0002_0001$$$::I break out of the trees, coming to a familiar plateau.[lr]::
712::$$$message_0002_0002_0002$$$::The moon is offensively beautiful tonight.[lr]::
713::$$$message_0002_0002_0003$$$::A silver-haired girl waits for my arrival, bathed in a pale light that makes her look frozen solid.::
714::$$$message_0002_0003_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
715::$$$message_0002_0003_0001$$$::"You're..."[lr]::
716::$$$message_0002_0003_0002$$$::Lightning runs through my brain.[lr]::
717::$$$message_0002_0003_0003$$$::Déjà vu runs rampant in my synapses.[lr]::
718::$$$message_0002_0003_0004$$$::I know her.[lr]::
719::$$$message_0002_0003_0005$$$::I've met her once. Or was it many times?[lr]::
720::$$$message_0002_0003_0006$$$::Shirou Emiya has died in front of this girl on countless nights.::
721::$$$message_0002_0004_0000$$$::...I move my feet.[lr]::
722::$$$message_0002_0004_0001$$$::I know what's happened to me before, but I feel neither hostility nor caution toward her.::
723::$$$message_0002_0005_0000$$$::Unarmed, I slowly close the distance...[lr]::
724::$$$message_0002_0005_0001$$$::"...Caren."[lr]::
725::$$$message_0002_0005_0002$$$::I hear her voice when I'm one step away.::
726::$$$message_0002_0006_0000$$$::"...What?"[lr]::
727::$$$message_0002_0006_0001$$$::"Caren Hortensia. That's my name."[lr]::
728::$$$message_0002_0006_0002$$$::Her voice is so indifferent, you'd think she's a machine.[lr]::
729::$$$message_0002_0006_0003$$$::Her businesslike coldness lets her do her work dispassionately.[lr]::
730::$$$message_0002_0006_0004$$$::Regardless, her voice...[lr]::
731::$$$message_0002_0006_0005$$$::"Caren...Hortensia."[lr]::
732::$$$message_0002_0006_0006$$$::...resonates in my chest like refined, emotional music.::
733::$$$message_0002_0007_0000$$$::"Ah...um, my name is..."[lr]::
734::$$$message_0002_0007_0001$$$::"I know. Shirou Emiya. You are Saber's Master and the victor of the Holy Grail War. [l][say storage=camp_10_kar_0031 name=カレン]I investigated you before coming here."::
735::$$$message_0002_0008_0000$$$::"You...investigated me?"[lr]::
736::$$$message_0002_0008_0001$$$::My thoughts unfreeze.[lr]::
737::$$$message_0002_0008_0002$$$::My dulled sense of caution sharpens again and warns me to get away from this girl.::
738::$$$message_0002_0009_0000$$$::"What's going on? I've never met you. Why are you looking into me?"[lr]::
739::$$$message_0002_0009_0001$$$::"...That fact is all the more reason to conduct my due diligence.[lr]::
740::$$$message_0002_0009_0002$$$::Shirou Emiya, you lack a precise understanding of who you are. Your manner suggests that you believe yourself to be harmless."::
741::$$$message_0002_0010_0000$$$::She inspects me.[lr]::
742::$$$message_0002_0010_0001$$$::...For some reason, I feel daunted.[lr]::
743::$$$message_0002_0010_0002$$$::Why do I feel the urge to admit she's right and apologize, even though she's being so casually rude?::
744::$$$message_0002_0011_0000$$$::"Urgh... I'm not...harmless, but that doesn't mean I'm a danger to anyone."[lr]::
745::$$$message_0002_0011_0001$$$::"So you [font italic=true]are[font italic=false] aware. Good.[lr]::
746::$$$message_0002_0011_0002$$$::If you had insisted on your harmlessness, I would have sentenced you to atone with hard labor... This reflects well on you."::
747::$$$message_0002_0012_0000$$$::"Uh...thanks."[lr]::
748::$$$message_0002_0012_0001$$$::She coldly states a fact.[lr]::
749::$$$message_0002_0012_0002$$$::...Her tone is oddly forceful. It makes me feel like I'm being scolded, for some reason.::
750::$$$message_0002_0013_0000$$$::"...Hang on. This is throwing me off. Whether I'm harmless or dangerous can wait.[lr]::
751::$$$message_0002_0013_0001$$$::More importantly, right now..."[lr]::
752::$$$message_0002_0013_0002$$$::There's something I need to ask her.[lr]::
753::$$$message_0002_0013_0003$$$::[chgfg textoff=0 time=300 pos=c storage=カレン戦闘服01a(中)]I need to know who she really is.[lr]::
754::$$$message_0002_0013_0004$$$::Why it feels wrong all over the city.[lr]::
755::$$$message_0002_0013_0005$$$::I want to know the truth of this recreated four-day Holy Grail War.::
756::$$$message_0002_0014_0000$$$::"Who in the world are you? Why are you investigating me?[lr]::
757::$$$message_0002_0014_0001$$$::...Actually, the city comes first. What are you trying to achieve, bringing all those monsters with you?"[lr]::
758::$$$message_0002_0014_0002$$$::"You think [font italic=true]I[font italic=false] brought the monsters...?"::
759::$$$message_0002_0015_0000$$$::"Wh-what? Trying to intimidate me won't work.[lr]::
760::$$$message_0002_0015_0001$$$::I'm sure I saw them[line len=2]well, [font italic=true]I[font italic=false] didn't see you, but you've been seen flooding the city with monsters.[lr]::
761::$$$message_0002_0015_0002$$$::Don't play dumb. It might work on someone else, but not me."::
762::$$$message_0002_0016_0000$$$::"Pazienza..."[lr]::
763::$$$message_0002_0016_0001$$$::I hear a creaking sound.[lr]::
764::$$$message_0002_0016_0002$$$::"O Lord. Forgive this one for his indiscretion.[lr]::
765::$$$message_0002_0016_0003$$$::...Also, calm my stubborn rage."[lr]::
766::$$$message_0002_0016_0004$$$::"Huh?"::
767::$$$message_0002_0017_0000$$$::"...Excuse me. I took up more of your time than I intended.[lr]::
768::$$$message_0002_0017_0001$$$::I didn't expect the victor of the Holy Grail War to be so...unperceptive."::
769::$$$message_0002_0018_0000$$$::"...I will answer your question. I was sent here to investigate and oversee you.[lr]::
770::$$$message_0002_0018_0001$$$::'You' being the mages who fought in the Holy Grail War.[lr]::
771::$$$message_0002_0018_0002$$$::My other objective is to investigate the presence of the Holy Grail which has reappeared."::
772::$$$message_0002_0019_0000$$$::Investigate? Oversee?[lr]::
773::$$$message_0002_0019_0001$$$::Where have I heard that before?[lr]::
774::$$$message_0002_0019_0002$$$::No no, more importantly, if she's investigating the Holy Grail...::
775::$$$message_0002_0020_0000$$$::"You're...not an enemy?"[lr]::
776::$$$message_0002_0020_0001$$$::"If that's what you believe, then I probably won't be treated as one... I can be harmful to others, but harmless people only see me as harmless."::
777::$$$message_0002_0021_0000$$$::She isn't lying.[lr]::
778::$$$message_0002_0021_0001$$$::She puts on a cordial front and she might mislead people, but she would never lie.[lr]::
779::$$$message_0002_0021_0002$$$::I have no evidence for this, but I'm sure of it.::
780::$$$message_0002_0022_0000$$$::"No, but..."[lr]::
781::$$$message_0002_0022_0001$$$::I did see her draw out the monsters.[lr]::
782::$$$message_0002_0022_0002$$$::On the fourth night,[lr]::
783::$$$message_0002_0022_0003$$$::when the moon was high in the sky, like tonight...::
784::$$$message_0002_0023_0000$$$::"...!!!"[lr]::
785::$$$message_0002_0023_0001$$$::The air changes.[lr]::
786::$$$message_0002_0023_0002$$$::Tremors paint over the world.::
787::$$$message_0002_0024_0000$$$::The sky is black.[lr]::
788::$$$message_0002_0024_0001$$$::Instantly, the familiar mountain scenery becomes hell on earth,[lr]::
789::$$$message_0002_0024_0002$$$::piled high with dead bodies.[wait canskip=false time=1000]::
790::$$$message_0002_0025_0000$$$::"Ngh...!?"[lr]::
791::$$$message_0002_0025_0001$$$::I glare at Caren.[lr]::
792::$$$message_0002_0025_0002$$$::She's bleeding and suffering, just like some other time.::
793::$$$message_0002_0026_0000$$$::"Tch...!"[wm canskip=0][lr]::
794::$$$message_0002_0026_0001$$$::...There are so many.[lr]::
795::$$$message_0002_0026_0002$$$::This is where those ghoulish monsters came from.[lr]::
796::$$$message_0002_0026_0003$$$::One by one, the piled bodies wake up and begin to surround us.::
797::$$$message_0002_0027_0000$$$::I hear a chorus of howls.[lr]::
798::$$$message_0002_0027_0001$$$::Inaudible low-frequency waves peel away my consciousness.[lr]::
799::$$$message_0002_0027_0002$$$::It feels awful, like a centipede crawled into my head through my ear and is tearing at my nerves.::
800::$$$message_0002_0028_0000$$$::"...Rgh.[lr]::
801::$$$message_0002_0028_0001$$$::...You said you're Caren. What the hell are these things? You're their master, right? Can't you calm them down?"[lr]::
802::$$$message_0002_0028_0002$$$::"...As I said, that is incorrect, Shirou Emiya. They have nothing to do with me."::
803::$$$message_0002_0029_0000$$$::"Mrgh. Really?"[lr]::
804::$$$message_0002_0029_0001$$$::"Really. I swear it before the Lord."[lr]::
805::$$$message_0002_0029_0002$$$::Seeming to recover from her mysterious bleeding, Caren calms her breathing and turns away from me.[lr]::
806::$$$message_0002_0029_0003$$$::"Wai[line len=2]What are you doing? You shouldn't move around so much if you're injured."::
807::$$$message_0002_0030_0000$$$::"...Right now, I am prioritizing your safety over my own.[lr]::
808::$$$message_0002_0030_0001$$$::They are unrelated to me. The only thing they see, no, the only thing they would voluntarily hurt is you."::
809::$$$message_0002_0031_0000$$$::The monsters have me surrounded.[lr]::
810::$$$message_0002_0031_0001$$$::Countless malicious gazes are directed at me, and only me.[lr]::
811::$$$message_0002_0031_0002$$$::"Only...me?"[lr]::
812::$$$message_0002_0031_0003$$$::Their claws, stained with entrails, indicate that they want to tear me limb from limb.[lr]::
813::$$$message_0002_0031_0004$$$::I know these things.[lr]::
814::$$$message_0002_0031_0005$$$::I've been ripped apart so many times before...::
815::$$$message_0002_0032_0000$$$::"That's right, you..."[lr]::
816::$$$message_0002_0032_0001$$$::She's like those monsters. No, they came from her body.[lr]::
817::$$$message_0002_0032_0002$$$::"...You've seen them before.[lr]::
818::$$$message_0002_0032_0003$$$::Be at ease. They won't affect me here.[lr]::
819::$$$message_0002_0032_0004$$$::No, they cannot transform me. Only phenomena called 'demons' can change me."::
820::$$$message_0002_0033_0000$$$::She explains impassively.[lr]::
821::$$$message_0002_0033_0001$$$::I hear a wet, rustling sound.[lr]::
822::$$$message_0002_0033_0002$$$::Caren's red shroud wraps around me from behind.[lr]::
823::$$$message_0002_0033_0003$$$::                      "[line len=3]Round and round, round and round[line len=3]!"[rf][lr]::
824::$$$message_0002_0033_0004$$$::What a drag. The only complaint I can think of is being drowned out by the noise from this beautiful cloth.::
825::$$$message_0002_0034_0000$$$::...It's in the way.[br]::
826::$$$message_0002_0034_0001$$$::I wish I could be calmer.[br]::
827::$$$message_0002_0034_0002$$$::I wish I could talk to her more.[br]::
828::$$$message_0002_0034_0003$$$::Never mind that. Right now...[wait canskip=0 time=1500][rep fliplr=0 tops=0 storages=@voice_04(object) time=100 flipud=0 lefts=0 bg=black indexes=1000][wait canskip=0 time=2000][br][cm]::
829::$$$message_0002_0034_0004$$$::"Hah... It doesn't...affect you...?"[lr]::
830::$$$message_0002_0034_0005$$$::"Correct. All of the monsters here will die. We can continue to converse."[lr]::
831::$$$message_0002_0034_0006$$$::"You say they'll die...but they're still moving around."[lr]::
832::$$$message_0002_0034_0007$$$::"They were never alive to begin with.[lr]::
833::$$$message_0002_0034_0008$$$::...You can tell if you watch them. They are merely corpses. Individually, none are particularly strong."::
834::$$$message_0002_0035_0000$$$::Corpses.[lr]::
835::$$$message_0002_0035_0001$$$::They were piled up like discarded, forgotten tools.[lr]::
836::$$$message_0002_0035_0002$$$::I wonder who threw them away.[lr]::
837::$$$message_0002_0035_0003$$$::I wouldn't say they're infinite, but the mountain of bodies is very, very high. There are probably over a hundred million bodies, a mind-numbing chain of death.[lr]::
838::$$$message_0002_0035_0004$$$::...That doesn't matter.[lr]::
839::$$$message_0002_0035_0005$$$::This damn noise has been grating on my ears this whole time.::
840::$$$message_0002_0036_0000$$$::"...Here they come. I will watch your back.[lr]::
841::$$$message_0002_0036_0001$$$::Do what you can to survive until the day changes."[lr]::
842::$$$message_0002_0036_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
843::$$$message_0002_0036_0003$$$::An avalanche begins.[lr]::
844::$$$message_0002_0036_0004$$$::The corpse mountain is collapsing.[lr]::
845::$$$message_0002_0036_0005$$$::Beasts that number as many as there are stars in the sky are coming to kill me.::
846::$$$message_0002_0037_0000$$$::"Ha...easy for you to say."[lr]::
847::$$$message_0002_0037_0001$$$::There's no time to hesitate.[lr]::
848::$$$message_0002_0037_0002$$$::I flip a switch in my brain.[lr]::
849::$$$message_0002_0037_0003$$$::I swap out my idyllic, peaceful self for the version of me that only defeats my enemies.[lr]::
850::$$$message_0002_0037_0004$$$::The transition is surprisingly smooth.[lr]::
851::$$$message_0002_0037_0005$$$::It's so easy. Wicked sadism punctures my iron logic.::
852::$$$message_0002_0038_0000$$$::[font italic=true]"Trace... (Begin...)"[font italic=false][lr]::
853::$$$message_0002_0038_0001$$$::I won't hesitate.[lr]::
854::$$$message_0002_0038_0002$$$::To be honest, I'm surrounded by so much garbage that I've long since lost my sanity.[lr]::
855::$$$message_0002_0038_0003$$$::[font italic=true]"...On. (...Projection.)"[font italic=false][lr]::
856::$$$message_0002_0038_0004$$$::I turn my Projected weapon on the trash before me!::
857::$$$message_0002_0039_0000$$$::Dust explodes outward.[lr]::
858::$$$message_0002_0039_0001$$$::Throngs of claws meet my blade.[lr]::
859::$$$message_0002_0039_0002$$$::Claws and fangs of skittering beasts descend on me from all directions.[wt canskip=0][current withback=false]::
860::$$$message_0002_0040_0000$$$::Sparks dance in the muddy moonlight.[lr]::
861::$$$message_0002_0040_0001$$$::I barely avoid claws meant to skewer my eyes and sweep my blade at the dead faces that threaten to kiss me.[lr]::
862::$$$message_0002_0040_0002$$$::Shattered, dead beasts press in on me.[lr]::
863::$$$message_0002_0040_0003$$$::The enemies swarm over their comrades' bodies, trying to impale me.::
864::$$$message_0002_0041_0000$$$::"...Hah...!"[lr]::
865::$$$message_0002_0041_0001$$$::It's like fighting back against a beehive.[lr]::
866::$$$message_0002_0041_0002$$$::Three attacks per second. All in all, I Project twelve weapons and hurl them at the beasts, scattering them to the winds.::
867::$$$message_0002_0042_0000$$$::"...Haaah, ah...!"[lr]::
868::$$$message_0002_0042_0001$$$::My breathing grows faster.[lr]::
869::$$$message_0002_0042_0002$$$::I meet the ceaseless assault with an endless, mad barrage.[lr]::
870::$$$message_0002_0042_0003$$$::The mountain behind the temple is bombarded by malice.[lr]::
871::$$$message_0002_0042_0004$$$::In the face of a literal avalanche of foes, I approach the limits of my mind and body.[wt canskip=0][current withback=false]::
872::$$$message_0002_0043_0000$$$::"...Ahh...haah...hah...!!!"[lr]::
873::$$$message_0002_0043_0001$$$::But there's no limit to my limits.[lr]::
874::$$$message_0002_0043_0002$$$::Just for tonight, the limits of my abilities are separate from my physical limits.[lr]::
875::$$$message_0002_0043_0003$$$::I abandon my bodily strength, accelerating my abilities without end.::
876::$$$message_0002_0044_0000$$$::The muscles swinging my blades have long since been stretched to exhaustion.[lr]::
877::$$$message_0002_0044_0001$$$::In contrast, my mind feels crystal clear.[lr]::
878::$$$message_0002_0044_0002$$$::I don't know if the weapons I'm Projecting are just that well-suited to me, but I construct them at furious speed, neither slowing down nor running out of magical energy.[lr]::
879::$$$message_0002_0044_0003$$$::If I can keep this up...[lr]::
880::$$$message_0002_0044_0004$$$::I can hold out until I die, not just for another thirty minutes.::
881::$$$message_0002_0045_0000$$$::Behind me, the girl is holding off the monsters.[lr]::
882::$$$message_0002_0045_0001$$$::Like a snake with a will of its own, her red shroud whips out to admonish, rebuke, and drive off the attackers.[wdash canskip=0][lr]::
883::$$$message_0002_0045_0002$$$::"Fuh, haah, hah... You damn...!"::
884::$$$message_0002_0046_0000$$$::She's so gentle it makes me jealous.[lr]::
885::$$$message_0002_0046_0001$$$::She fights defensively, denying yet nearly inviting the beasts in. Masochism and sadism. Rejection and affirmation. This girl demonstrates contradictory ideas at the same time. Ha. No thanks. If I let that embrace me, its warmth would make me lose my edge.[wt canskip=0][current withback=false]::
886::$$$message_0002_0047_0000$$$::She's defending my back to the death.[lr]::
887::$$$message_0002_0047_0001$$$::That's why I'm still alive.[lr]::
888::$$$message_0002_0047_0002$$$::That's why I'm still annihilating the teeming corpses.[lr]::
889::$$$message_0002_0047_0003$$$::   She's in the way.[lr]::
890::$$$message_0002_0047_0004$$$::I don't know exactly why I feel this way.[lr]::
891::$$$message_0002_0047_0005$$$::I'm so _____ for this woman I can hardly stand it.::
892::$$$message_0002_0048_0000$$$::A grand, repeating chorus.[lr]::
893::$$$message_0002_0048_0001$$$::A lethal, mass prayer.[lr]::
894::$$$message_0002_0048_0002$$$::"Ngh, hah...!"[lr]::
895::$$$message_0002_0048_0003$$$::I'm in perfect form. Even with over one hundred million enemies before me... I won't lose!::
896::$$$message_0002_0049_0000$$$::"Hah... Ah, hah, hah...!"[lr]::
897::$$$message_0002_0049_0001$$$::Shut up.[lr]::
898::$$$message_0002_0049_0002$$$::Shut up.[lr]::
899::$$$message_0002_0049_0003$$$::Shut up, shut up, shut up![lr]::
900::$$$message_0002_0049_0004$$$::Shut the fuck up you scum I've never felt this good [delay speed=30]my head feels like it's on fire [delay speed=20][se storage=se625.wav]I can't stop my tiny consciousness from growing [delay speed=10]I keep making them constantly, making them incessantly, rushing in nonstop, [se storage=se627.wav]Aaaahhh, it's so, it's so, it's so...[wait canskip=0 time=200][br]::
901::$$$message_0002_0049_0005$$$::"Hah... Haha, hahahaha, ah...!"[br]::
902::$$$message_0002_0049_0006$$$::I'm so close, so don't be a buzzkill...![wdash canskip=0][fg textoff=0 opacity=0 left=0 index=1000 top=0 time=100 storage=51黒い月]::
903::$$$message_0002_0050_0000$$$::"Hah, haah, haah, ha...Wait, what...?"[lr]::
904::$$$message_0002_0050_0001$$$::The corpse mountain fades.[lr]::
905::$$$message_0002_0050_0002$$$::The turbid air clears, and the muddy moon regains its cherubic glow.::
906::$$$message_0002_0051_0000$$$::I run out of magical energy to maintain the dagger in my hand, which shatters.[lr]::
907::$$$message_0002_0051_0001$$$::"They're...gone?"[lr]::
908::$$$message_0002_0051_0002$$$::We must have passed midnight at some point.[lr]::
909::$$$message_0002_0051_0003$$$::The frenzy that set my mind on fire cools as if it were all a lie.::
910::$$$message_0002_0052_0000$$$::I sink to my knees,[lr]::
911::$$$message_0002_0052_0001$$$::too exhausted to take another step.[lr]::
912::$$$message_0002_0052_0002$$$::Sanity, magical energy, physical strength. I wrung myself dry of everything I had, so this was only to be expected.[lr]::
913::$$$message_0002_0052_0003$$$::"...You're terrible."[lr]::
914::$$$message_0002_0052_0004$$$::Caren looks the same as she always does.[lr]::
915::$$$message_0002_0052_0005$$$::My head is too tired to understand what she's looking down on.::
916::$$$message_0002_0053_0000$$$::"But you pass. Finally, we meet."[lr]::
917::$$$message_0002_0053_0001$$$::...Her voice sounds distant.[lr]::
918::$$$message_0002_0053_0002$$$::Is that Tohsaka?[clfg textoff=0 pos=all rule=シャッター左から time=400][lr]::
919::$$$message_0002_0053_0003$$$::I think she's running this way from Ryudou Temple. She must have sensed that something was wrong.::
920::$$$message_0002_0054_0000$$$::Caren starts to disappear into the forest. She must not have any business with Tohsaka.[lr]::
921::$$$message_0002_0054_0001$$$::"Wait. I still have something to[line len=2]"[lr]::
922::$$$message_0002_0054_0002$$$::"No, our meeting is over. You can't handle any more.[lr]::
923::$$$message_0002_0054_0003$$$::...But now, another [font italic=true]blank[font italic=false] has been filled in. Now we can meet whenever you want."::
924::$$$message_0002_0055_0000$$$::I hear footsteps approaching.[lr]::
925::$$$message_0002_0055_0001$$$::Tohsaka is running this way from the forest path.::
926::$$$message_0002_0056_0000$$$::"Sweet dreams. Please visit me alone at my home after you wake up."[wvs][wait canskip=0 time=400][clfg textoff=0 pos=all rule=シャッター左から time=400]::
927::$$$message_0002_0057_0000$$$::Her silver hair disappears into the trees.[lr]::
928::$$$message_0002_0057_0001$$$::The girl calling herself Caren would never appear before me again.[lr]::
929::$$$message_0002_0057_0002$$$::The next time we meet will be after I solve this phenomenon.[lr]::
930::$$$message_0002_0057_0003$$$::It'll be our first meeting, and we'll introduce ourselves again.::
931::$$$message_0002_0058_0000$$$::"...Hah..."[lr]::
932::$$$message_0002_0058_0001$$$::If Tohsaka's coming, then I can sleep, right?[lr]::
933::$$$message_0002_0058_0002$$$::...I'm tired. I want to sleep.[lr]::
934::$$$message_0002_0058_0003$$$::I hear multiple people running this way.[lr]::
935::$$$message_0002_0058_0004$$$::Looking back, this would be Shirou Emiya's big night.::
936::$$$message_0002_0059_0000$$$::I close my eyes and fall asleep.[lr]::
937::$$$message_0002_0059_0001$$$::I've gotten past the fourth night. When I wake up, everything should be back to normal.[lr]::
938::$$$message_0002_0059_0002$$$::                                "WILl YOU oNlY SaVe yOURsElF agAin?"[rf][lr]::
939::$$$message_0002_0059_0003$$$::A faint, cursed voice lingers in my ears.[lr]::
940::$$$message_0002_0059_0004$$$::I'll completely forget it by the time I'm awake.::
900788::$$$message_9002_0024_0001$$$::Instantly, the familiar mountain scenery becomes hell on earth, piled high with dead bodies.::

